# Arduino build outputs
**/build/
*.bin
*.elf
*.map
*.merged.bin
*.bootloader.bin
*.partitions.bin

# --- Published firmware binaries -------------------------------------------
# These three negations are the ONLY .bin files that reach GitHub. Everything else
# stays local.
#
# ⚠️ The rules below work ONLY because their parent directories are not themselves
# excluded. Git cannot re-include a file whose parent DIRECTORY is ignored — it never
# descends far enough to see the negation. That is exactly why the old
# "!firmware/**/*.bin" pair here did nothing at all: line ~60 ignores "firmware/"
# wholesale, so those negations were dead the day they were written, and the repo
# silently shipped no binaries for months.
#
# Curated releases live beside their source, ~1.3 MB each, no .merged.bin (4 MB each,
# and a full-flash image is the wrong thing to hand a user who just wants to update).
!Source/V2_Integration_Rx/RX firmware/
!Source/V2_Integration_Rx/RX firmware/*.bin
!Source/V2_Integration_Tx/TX firmware/
!Source/V2_Integration_Tx/TX firmware/*.bin

